#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The traders weigh their silver on small scales: a broken piece of a bracelet buys as much as a "
"coin of the same weight."
msgstr ""
"Tregtarët e peshojnë argjendin me peshore të vogla: një copë byzylyku e thyer blen aq sa një "
"monedhë me të njëjtën peshë."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The combs of antler are so precious that people are buried with them."
msgstr "Krehrat prej briri janë aq të çmuar sa njerëzit varrosen bashkë me ta."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings make their sails of wool; it takes a weaver a whole year to weave a big one."
msgstr ""
"Vikingët i bëjnë velat prej leshi; një endëseje i duhet një vit i tërë për të endur një velë të "
"madhe."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey is the only sweet the vikings know, so the bees are worth a lot."
msgstr "Mjalti është e vetmja gjë e ëmbël që njohin vikingët, prandaj bletët vlejnë shumë."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The runes are carved in straight lines, so that they are easy to cut in wood and stone."
msgstr "Runat gdhenden me vija të drejta, që të priten lehtë në dru dhe në gur."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "In winter, the lakes freeze, and people travel on skates made of horse bones."
msgstr "Në dimër liqenet ngrijnë dhe njerëzit udhëtojnë me patina prej kockash kali."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Women hold the keys of the house: a woman with keys on her belt runs the farm."
msgstr "Gratë mbajnë çelësat e shtëpisë: gruaja me çelësa në brez drejton fermën."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings give their boats names, like Long Serpent or Sea Horse."
msgstr "Vikingët u vënë emra barkave të tyre, si Gjarpri i Gjatë ose Kali i Detit."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cats on the farms catch the mice in the grain stores, so everybody loves them."
msgstr "Macet e fermave kapin minjtë në hambarët e drithit, prandaj të gjithë i duan."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good horse is worth more than a whole boatload of fish."
msgstr "Një kalë i mirë vlen më shumë se një barkë plot me peshk."

