#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "News on the Water"
msgstr "Lajme mbi ujë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A good trader asks before she sells. Hail three boats on the lakes and ask about the price of "
"wool. Then sell a crate of wool where it pays."
msgstr ""
"Një tregtar i mirë pyet para se të shesë. {crew|Përshëndet|Përshëndet|Përshëndetni} tri barka në "
"liqene dhe {crew|pyet|pyet|pyesni} për çmimin e leshit. Pastaj {crew|shit|shit|shitni} një arkë me"
" lesh atje ku paguhet më mirë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now you know more than most traders! Sell your wool where they want it."
msgstr ""
"Tani {crew|di|di|dini} më shumë se shumica e tregtarëve! {crew|Shite|Shite|Shiteni} leshin atje ku"
" e duan."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool? They always need it at the weaver in Guldvik."
msgstr "Lesh? Te endësja në Guldvik kanë gjithmonë nevojë për të."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The market in Kråkhamn buys wool too, they say."
msgstr "Thonë se edhe tregu në Kråkhamn blen lesh."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good soft wool! I will spin it into yarn and weave it into cloth. Thank you."
msgstr "Lesh i butë e i mirë! Do ta tjerr në fije dhe do ta end në pëlhurë. Faleminderit."

