#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Midsummer night at my hall! We need two crates of mead, and garlands of flowers from Solby for the"
" maypole. Come yourselves, in your new dresses!"
msgstr ""
"Nata e Mesverës në sallën time! Na duhen dy arka me hidromel dhe kurora lulesh nga Solby për "
"shtyllën e festës. {crew|Eja|Eja|Ejani} edhe {crew|vetë|vetë|ju vetë}, me fustanet e reja!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead for the feast! Now the garlands."
msgstr "Hidromel për festën! Tani kurorat."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We wove them all morning. They smell of summer!"
msgstr "I thurëm gjithë mëngjesin. Kanë erë vere!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/017_midsummer_night/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The garlands are up, the torches are lit, and everybody dances around the pole! Uncle Sven sings "
"too loud. What a night!"
msgstr ""
"Kurorat u varën, pishtarët u ndezën dhe të gjithë kërcejnë rreth shtyllës! Xhaxha Sven këndon "
"shumë fort. Çfarë nate!"

