#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your kitten is gone! She did not come for her milk this morning. Ask the boats on the lakes if "
"anyone has seen her."
msgstr ""
"Kotelja {crew|jote|jote|juaj} u zhduk! Këtë mëngjes nuk erdhi për qumështin. "
"{crew|Pyet|Pyet|Pyetni} barkat në liqene nëse e ka parë dikush."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A grey kitten? I saw one jump off a boat at Kråkhamn, by the boathouse!"
msgstr "Një kotele gri? Pashë një që u hodh nga një barkë në Kråkhamn, pranë kasolles së barkave!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/018_the_kitten_in_the_boathouse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A grey kitten? No... but cats love warm, quiet places with wood shavings."
