"Frosttorp, and bring them home."
msgstr ""
"Vezët shiten aq mirë! Le të kemi gjashtë pula. {crew|Bli|Bli|Blini} pula në tregun e Kråkhamn ose "
"në fermën e Frosttorp, dhe {crew|silli|silli|sillini} në shtëpi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Six hens! Cluck, cluck, scratch, scratch. Do not forget: they eat grain."
msgstr "Gjashtë pula! Kot-kot, gërvisht-gërvisht. Mos {crew|harro|harro|harroni}: hanë drithë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/031_a_henhouse_full/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking hens were small and laid fewer eggs than ours, but every farm had some."
msgstr "Pulat e vikingëve ishin të vogla dhe bënin më pak vezë se tonat, por çdo fermë kishte disa."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey Cakes"
msgstr "Kuleçë me mjaltë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We want to sell honey cakes on the market! But we have no oven. Bring honey and grain to your "
"grandmother; she bakes them overnight, and you bring us the cakes."
msgstr ""
"Duam të shesim kuleçë me mjaltë në treg! Por nuk kemi furrë. {crew|Çoji|Çoji|Çojini} mjaltë dhe "
"drithë gjyshes; ajo i pjek gjatë natës, dhe {crew|na i sjell|na i sjell|na i sillni} kuleçët."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey! Now the grain."
msgstr "Mjaltë! Tani drithi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I bake them tonight. Come for them in the morning!"
msgstr "I pjek sonte. {crew|Eja|Eja|Ejani} t'i {crew|marrësh|marrësh|merrni} në mëngjes!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Still warm. Do not eat them all on the way!"
msgstr "Ende të ngrohtë. Mos i {crew|ha|ha|hani} të gjithë rrugës!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "They smell so good! Everybody comes to our stall. Here, half the silver is yours."
msgstr ""
"Kanë erë kaq të mirë! Të gjithë vijnë te tezga jonë. Ja, gjysma e argjendit është "
"{crew|jotja|jotja|juaja}."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cakes"
