#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/032_honey_cakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking bread was flat and baked on hot stones; honey made it a treat."
msgstr "Buka e vikingëve ishte e sheshtë dhe piqej mbi gurë të nxehtë; mjalti e bënte ëmbëlsirë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Chieftain's Feast"
msgstr "Festa e prijësit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Thora turns twelve! A feast with the whole valley: bring me three crates of mead and "
"two of cheese, within three days."
msgstr ""
"Vajza ime Thora mbush dymbëdhjetë vjeç! Një festë me gjithë luginën: {crew|më sill|më sill|më "
"sillni} tri arka me hidromel dhe dy me djathë, brenda tri ditësh."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The mead! The skalds will sing."
msgstr "Hidromeli! Skaldët do të këndojnë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese, mead, songs and a fire! Come in, sit by me: it is the best birthday ever."
msgstr ""
"Djathë, hidromel, këngë dhe zjarr! {crew|Hyr|Hyr|Hyni}, {crew|ulu|ulu|uluni} pranë meje: është "
"ditëlindja më e bukur ndonjëherë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/033_the_chieftains_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A chieftain's hall had a long fire in the middle, and benches along the walls."
msgstr "Salla e një prijësi kishte një zjarr të gjatë në mes, dhe stola përgjatë mureve."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ferryman's Tale"
msgstr "Përralla e varkëtarit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Old Halvard told a story here last night: a hidden cove, where the swans of the lakes are born. He"
" says: ask the potter, the miller and the old man of Svanetorp."
msgstr ""
"Plaku Halvard tregoi një histori këtu mbrëmë: një gji i fshehur, ku lindin mjellmat e liqeneve. Ai"
" thotë: {crew|pyet|pyet|pyetni} poçaren, mullixheshën dhe plakun e Svanetorp."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cove? My grandmother said: it lies where the reeds grow tallest. Ask Astrid."
msgstr ""
"Gjiri? Gjyshja ime thoshte: ndodhet aty ku kallamat rriten më të lartë. {crew|Pyet|Pyet|Pyetni} "
"Astridën."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Reeds? The tallest ones grow south, by Svanetorp. Go to Grim."
msgstr "Kallama? Më të lartët rriten në jug, pranë Svanetorp. {crew|Shko|Shko|Shkoni} te Grim."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So you found my secret. Behind my farm, in the reeds: the swan cove. Look, the cygnets! Grey and "
"fluffy. Tell no one!"
msgstr ""
"Pra, e {crew|gjete|gjete|gjetët} sekretin tim. Pas fermës sime, mes kallamave: gjiri i mjellmave. "
"{crew|Shiko|Shiko|Shikoni}, zogjtë e mjellmës! Gri dhe me push. Mos i {crew|thuaj|thuaj|thoni} "
"askujt!"

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "the secret of the swan cove"
msgstr "sekreti i gjirit të mjellmave"

#. the thing 'the secret of the swan cove' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the
#. direct object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain
#. translation
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "the secret of the swan cove"
msgstr "sekretin e gjirit të mjellmave"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/034_the_ferrymans_tale/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Young swans are grey, not white; they are called cygnets."
msgstr "Mjellmat e reja janë gri, jo të bardha; quhen zogj mjellme."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool for the Winter Cloth"
msgstr "Lesh për pëlhurën e dimrit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everybody wants warm cloth for the winter, and my looms are hungry. Bring me four crates of wool, "
"and I give you a bolt of red cloth."
msgstr ""
"Të gjithë duan pëlhurë të ngrohtë për dimrin, dhe vegjët e mia kanë uri. {crew|Më sill|Më sill|Më "
"sillni} katër arka me lesh, dhe {crew|të jap|të jap|ju jap} një top pëlhure të kuqe."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Clack, clack, goes the loom. Here: the reddest cloth I ever made, for you."
msgstr "Tak-tak, bën vegja. Ja: pëlhura më e kuqe që kam bërë ndonjëherë, për {crew|ty|ty|ju}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/035_wool_for_the_winter_cloth/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The women of a viking farm wove all the cloth: sails, clothes and blankets."
msgstr "Gratë e një ferme vikinge endnin gjithë pëlhurën: vela, rroba dhe batanije."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flax in the Field"
msgstr "Li në arë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Linen is softer than wool on the skin. Plant flax on your farm! When it blooms blue and is ripe, "
"bring me two crates."
msgstr ""
"Pëlhura e lirit është më e butë se leshi mbi lëkurë. {crew|Mbill|Mbill|Mbillni} li në fermë! Kur "
"të lulëzojë blu dhe të piqet, {crew|më sill|më sill|më sillni} dy arka."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flax seed in the field. In a few days, it blooms blue."
msgstr "Farë liri në arë. Pas disa ditësh, lulëzon blu."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your own flax! I will make you linen shirts, soft as a cloud."
msgstr "Liri {crew|yt|yt|juaj}! Do {crew|të të|të të|t'ju} bëj këmisha liri, të buta si reja."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "linen shirts"
msgstr "këmisha liri"

#. the thing 'linen shirts' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the direct object),
#. e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain translation
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "linen shirts"
msgstr ""

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/036_flax_in_the_field/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flax was soaked, beaten and combed for weeks before it could be spun into linen."
msgstr "Liri njomej, rrihej dhe krehej me javë të tëra para se të tjerrej në pëlhurë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley for the Brewer"
msgstr "Elb për birraxhiun"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Orm of Hallvik wants the biggest barrel of ale for the autumn feast. I need grain, five crates! "
"Bring them, and you get two crates of my ale."
msgstr ""
"Orm nga Hallvik do fuçinë më të madhe me birrë për festën e vjeshtës. Më duhet drithë, pesë arka! "
"{crew|Silli|Silli|Sillini}, dhe {crew|merr|merr|merrni} dy arka me birrën time."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Into the water with it, let it sprout... In a week, the best ale of the lakes!"
msgstr "Në ujë me të, le të mbijë... Pas një jave, birra më e mirë e liqeneve!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/037_barley_for_the_brewer/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale was brewed from barley and water, often with herbs instead of hops."
msgstr "Birra bëhej me elb dhe ujë, shpesh me barishte në vend të lulebirrës."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Proper Hold"
msgstr "Hapësirë e vërtetë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are real traders now: you need a real hold! Bring me eight planks from Frosttorp and two "
"crates of iron tools, and pay 20 silver. Then your hold takes two more crates."
msgstr ""
"Tani {crew|je tregtar i vërtetë|je tregtare e vërtetë|jeni tregtarë të vërtetë|jeni tregtare të "
"vërteta}: {crew|të duhet|të duhet|ju duhet} hapësirë e vërtetë! {crew|Më sill|Më sill|Më sillni} "
"tetë dërrasa nga Frosttorp dhe dy arka me vegla hekuri, dhe {crew|paguaj|paguaj|paguani} 20 "
"argjend. Atëherë barka nxë edhe dy arka."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks of pine, split with wedges. Stack them well!"
msgstr "Dërrasa pishe, të çara me pyka. {crew|Radhiti|Radhiti|Radhitini} mirë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good iron! Now my wages."
msgstr "Hekur i mirë! Tani pagesa ime."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/038_a_proper_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Saw, plane, rivets... Look at her! Longer, wider, and room for two more crates."
msgstr ""
"Sharrë, zdrukth, gozhdë... {crew|Shikoje|Shikoje|Shikojeni}! Më e gjatë, më e gjerë, dhe vend për "
"edhe dy arka."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
