#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Messenger's Cold"
msgstr "Lajmëtarja e ftohur"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Atchoo! I have a cold, and I must tell the smith, the horse farm and the herders about the autumn "
"feast at Hallvik. Can you do it today? Atchoo!"
msgstr ""
"Apçiii! Jam ftohur, dhe duhet t'u tregoj farkëtarit, fermës së kuajve dhe barinjve për festën e "
"vjeshtës në Hallvik. A {crew|mund ta bësh|mund ta bësh|mund ta bëni} sot? Apçiii!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The autumn feast? I will bring my best knives to show."
msgstr "Festa e vjeshtës? Do të sjell thikat e mia më të mira për t'i treguar."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We will come with all the horses! Tell Inga to drink hot honey water."
msgstr ""
"Do të vijmë me të gjithë kuajt! {crew|Thuaji|Thuaji|Thuajini} Ingës të pijë ujë të nxehtë me "
"mjaltë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast! I will bring my flute. Thank you!"
msgstr "Festë! Do të sjell fyellin. Faleminderit!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/039_the_messengers_cold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Messengers rowed, rode and ran: news could cross a land in a few days."
msgstr "Lajmëtarët vozitnin, kalëronin dhe vraponin: lajmet mund të kalonin një vend në pak ditë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for Frosttorp"
msgstr "Sanë për Frosttorp"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hay meadow was flooded, and the cows are hungry! I need eight crates of hay. Your big boat can "
"do it in one trip."
msgstr ""
"Livadhi im u përmbyt, dhe lopët kanë uri! Më duhen tetë arka me sanë. Barka {crew|jote|jote|juaj} "
"e madhe mund ta bëjë me një udhëtim."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Moo! Listen to them, they are happy. You saved my winter. Take this cheese."
msgstr ""
"Muuu! {crew|Dëgjoji|Dëgjoji|Dëgjojini}, janë të lumtura. {crew|Ma shpëtove|Ma shpëtove|Ma "
"shpëtuat} dimrin. {crew|Merre|Merre|Merreni} këtë djathë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/040_hay_for_frosttorp/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay is dried grass; without enough of it, a farm could not keep its animals over winter."
msgstr ""
"Sana është bar i tharë; pa mjaftueshëm sanë, një fermë nuk mund t'i mbante kafshët gjatë dimrit."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sigvor's Cheese"
msgstr "Djathi i Sigvorit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My goats gave so much milk this summer! I made four big wheels of cheese for Orm's autumn feast in"
" Hallvik, but my boat is full of goats. Will you carry them?"
msgstr ""
"Dhitë e mia dhanë kaq shumë qumësht këtë verë! Bëra katër rrota të mëdha djathi për festën e "
"vjeshtës te Orm në Hallvik, por barka ime është plot me dhi. A {crew|do t'i çosh|do t'i çosh|do "
"t'i çoni}?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sigvor's cheese! The guests will fight over it. Well, not fight: they will ask nicely."
msgstr ""
"Djathi i Sigvorit! Mysafirët do të grinden për të. Epo, jo të grinden: do ta kërkojnë me "
"mirësjellje."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Roll them in gently. And no nibbling!"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Rrokullisi|Rrokullisi|Rrokullisini} butë brenda. Dhe mos {crew|kafsho|kafsho|kafshoni} gjë!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese"
msgstr "Djathë"

#. a thing of a task; {count|...|...} picks the form for the number {count} (one, then the others;
