#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/041_sigvors_cheese/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cheese keeps the milk of the summer for the winter."
msgstr "Djathi e ruan qumështin e verës për dimrin."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Cow of Our Own"
msgstr "Një lopë e jona"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With the east meadow, we have room for a cow at last! Buy one at the horse farm in Torsgården. A "
"cow is big, but she fits in your boat like a crate, if she stands still."
msgstr ""
"Me livadhin lindor, më në fund kemi vend për një lopë! {crew|Bli|Bli|Blini} një në fermën e kuajve"
" në Torsgården. Lopa është e madhe, por hyn në barkë si një arkë, po të qëndrojë e qetë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look at her big brown eyes! She will give us milk every day. Let us call her Rosa."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Shiko|Shiko|Shikoni} sytë e saj të mëdhenj kafe! Do të na japë qumësht çdo ditë. Le ta "
"quajmë Rosa."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/042_a_cow_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cows were the wealth of a farm: a family counted its riches in cows."
msgstr "Lopët ishin pasuria e një ferme: një familje e numëronte pasurinë në lopë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Pots for Ekvik"
msgstr "Enë për Ekvik"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fish soup! We cook it for the whole village, but our big pot cracked. Bring us three crates of"
" pots from the potter, please."
msgstr ""
"Supa e peshkut! E gatuajmë për gjithë fshatin, por kusia jonë e madhe u plas. {crew|Na sill|Na "
"sill|Na sillni} tri arka me enë nga poçarja, {crew|të lutem|të lutem|ju lutem}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "New pots! Tonight there is fish soup for everybody, and for you two the first bowl."
msgstr "Enë të reja! Sonte ka supë peshku për të gjithë, dhe tasi i parë për {crew|ty|ty|ju të dy}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/043_pots_for_ekvik/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cooking pot hung over the fire on a chain, and the soup simmered all day."
msgstr "Kusia e gatimit varej mbi zjarr me një zinxhir, dhe supa ziente ngadalë gjithë ditën."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ragna's Broken Oar"
msgstr "Rremi i thyer i Ragnës"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ragna rowed out at dawn and is not back! I fear her oar broke. Find her on the lakes, then come "
"back and fetch the spare oar for her."
msgstr ""
"Ragna doli me barkë në agim dhe nuk është kthyer! Kam frikë se i është thyer rremi. "
"{crew|Gjeje|Gjeje|Gjejeni} në liqene, pastaj {crew|kthehu|kthehu|kthehuni} dhe "
"{crew|merr|merr|merrni} rremin rezervë për të."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hello! Yes, my oar broke, and I drift with one. Tell Tor to give you the spare one!"
msgstr ""
"Përshëndetje! Po, m'u thye rremi, dhe po shkoj pas ujit me një. {crew|Thuaji|Thuaji|Thuajini} "
"Torit {crew|të të japë|të të japë|t'ju japë} rremin rezervë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She is well? Thank the gods. Here is the oar: bring it to her!"
msgstr "Është mirë? Falë zotave. Ja rremi: {crew|çoja|çoja|çojani} asaj!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My oar! Now I can row again. Here, take some fish: the freshest on the lakes."
msgstr ""
"Rremi im! Tani mund të vozis përsëri. Ja, {crew|merr|merr|merrni} pak peshk: më i freskëti në "
"liqene."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/044_ragnas_broken_oar/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every viking boat carried spare oars: a broken oar was common."
msgstr "Çdo barkë vikinge mbante rrema rezervë: një rrem i thyer ishte gjë e zakonshme."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Torches for the Dark"
msgstr "Pishtarë për errësirën"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The nights grow long. The guests of the autumn feast need light: bring me tar for torches, two "
"pots from Ekvik, and two crates of flax for the wicks."
msgstr ""
"Netët zgjaten. Mysafirëve të festës së vjeshtës u duhet dritë: {crew|më sill|më sill|më sillni} "
"katran për pishtarë, dy poçe nga Ekvik, dhe dy arka me li për fitilat."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tar for torches? They burn bright and long."
msgstr "Katran për pishtarë? Digjen me dritë dhe gjatë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tar and flax: now my torches will light up the whole bay!"
msgstr "Katran dhe li: tani pishtarët e mi do të ndriçojnë gjithë gjirin!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/045_torches_for_the_dark/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking torches were sticks wrapped in flax or cloth, soaked in tar or fat."
msgstr ""
"Pishtarët e vikingëve ishin shkopinj të mbështjellë me li ose pëlhurë, të njomur në katran ose "
"dhjamë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Autumn Feast"
msgstr "Festa e vjeshtës"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The autumn feast is tomorrow! Knut's ale is ready, five barrels. Bring them from Lindtorp, and "
"bring three crates of fish for the soup too."
msgstr ""
"Festa e vjeshtës është nesër! Birra e Knutit është gati, pesë fuçi. {crew|Sill|Sill|Sillni} nga "
"Lindtorp, dhe {crew|sill|sill|sillni} edhe tri arka me peshk për supën."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ale! Now the fish."
msgstr "Birra! Tani peshku."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The biggest batch I ever brewed! Five barrels for Orm."
msgstr "Sasia më e madhe që kam bërë ndonjëherë! Pesë fuçi për Ormin."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/046_the_autumn_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale, soup, torches, Sten's flute and Hrafn's knives! Everybody is here. Dance with us!"
msgstr ""
"Birrë, supë, pishtarë, fyelli i Stenit dhe thikat e Hrafnit! Të gjithë janë këtu. "
"{crew|Kërce|Kërce|Kërceni} me ne!"

