#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The First Snow"
msgstr "Bora e parë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Snowflakes! Winter is near. Our store needs feed for the animals: six crates of hay and four of "
"grain. Your hold takes eight: think how to row it!"
msgstr ""
"Flokë bore! Dimri është afër. Hambari ka nevojë për ushqim për kafshët: gjashtë arka me sanë dhe "
"katër me drithë. Barka nxë tetë: {crew|mendo|mendo|mendoni} si ta {crew|sjellësh|sjellësh|sillni}!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for the sheep, the goats and Rosa. Now the grain."
msgstr "Sanë për delet, dhitë dhe Rosën. Tani drithi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full! Let the snow come. Come in, the soup is hot."
msgstr "Hambari është plot! Le të vijë bora. {crew|Hyr|Hyr|Hyni} brenda, supa është e nxehtë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/050_the_first_snow/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "In winter, the animals stayed in the barn for months and ate the hay of the summer."
msgstr "Në dimër, kafshët rrinin në stallë me muaj dhe hanin sanën e verës."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Ice Breaks"
msgstr "Akulli çahet"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Hear that crack? The ice breaks: spring is here again! Row out and hail two boats: ask how "
"everybody got through the winter."
msgstr ""
"E {crew|dëgjon|dëgjon|dëgjoni} këtë krisje? Akulli çahet: pranvera erdhi përsëri! "
"{crew|Dil|Dil|Dilni} me barkë dhe {crew|përshëndet|përshëndet|përshëndetni} dy barka: "
"{crew|pyet|pyet|pyetni} si e kaluan të gjithë dimrin."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everybody is well! But Tova has asked for you all winter. Row to Laxön!"
msgstr ""
"Të gjithë janë mirë! Por Tova ka pyetur për {crew|ty|ty|ju} gjithë dimrin. "
"{crew|Vozit|Vozit|Vozitni} në Laxön!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A long winter! But the herring kept, thanks to your salt."
msgstr "Dimër i gjatë! Por harengat u ruajtën, falë kripës {crew|sate|sate|suaj}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There you are! Spring is when the animals need us most. Will you be my apprentices, and learn to "
"heal?"
msgstr ""
"Ja ku {crew|je|je|jeni}! Në pranverë kafshët kanë më shumë nevojë për ne. A {crew|do të bëhesh "
"nxënësi im|do të bëhesh nxënësja ime|do të bëheni nxënësit e mi|do të bëheni nxënëset e mia}, që "
"të {crew|mësosh|mësosh|mësoni} të {crew|shërosh|shërosh|shëroni}?"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/051_the_ice_breaks/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the ice broke in spring, the boats came out, and with them the news."
msgstr "Kur akulli çahej në pranverë, dilnin barkat, dhe me to lajmet."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Coughing Horse"
msgstr "Kali që kollitet"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your first case as healers: Ragnfrid's old horse Bror coughs. Take him this syrup of thyme and "
"honey, then come back to me after a night, to hear how he is."
msgstr ""
"Rasti {crew|yt|yt|juaj} i parë si {crew|shërues|shëruese|shërues|shëruese}: kali i vjetër i "
"Ragnfridës, Bror, kollitet. {crew|Çoji|Çoji|Çojini} këtë shurup me trumzë dhe mjaltë, pastaj "
"{crew|kthehu|kthehu|kthehuni} te unë pas një nate, të {crew|dëgjosh|dëgjosh|dëgjoni} si është."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thyme and honey? Bror loves it. He licks the spoon!"
msgstr "Trumzë dhe mjaltë? Brorit i pëlqen shumë. E lëpin lugën!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "He slept the whole night and coughs no more. Tell Tova: her apprentices are good!"
msgstr ""
"Fjeti gjithë natën dhe nuk kollitet më. {crew|Thuaji|Thuaji|Thuajini} Tovës: nxënësit e saj janë "
"të mirë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Well done! You listened, you waited, you looked. That is healing."
msgstr ""
"Të lumtë! {crew|Dëgjove, prite, vështrove|Dëgjove, prite, vështrove|Dëgjuat, pritët, vështruat}. "
"Kjo është shërimi."

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
