msgid "The Lame Goat"
msgstr "Dhia që çalon"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My best goat, Hedda, limps! A thorn, I think, but she won't let me look. Take her to Tova on "
"Laxön. She takes the room of a crate, and she butts!"
msgstr ""
"Dhia ime më e mirë, Hedda, çalon! Një gjemb, mendoj, por nuk më lë ta shikoj. "
"{crew|Çoje|Çoje|Çojeni} te Tova në Laxön. Zë vendin e një arke, dhe godet me brirë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hold her head, gently... There: a big thorn. Leave her with me tonight, with a herb wrap."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Mbaja|Mbaja|Mbajani} kokën, me kujdes... Ja: një gjemb i madh. {crew|Lëre|Lëre|Lëreni} te "
"unë sonte, me një fashë me barishte."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hedda! She jumps like a kid again. Here, the best cheese I have."
msgstr "Hedda! Hidhet si kec përsëri. Ja, djathi më i mirë që kam."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She walks well again. Take her home!"
msgstr "Ecën mirë përsëri. {crew|Çoje|Çoje|Çojeni} në shtëpi!"

