#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sunny Hill"
msgstr "Kodra me diell"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My old aunt Gerd moves to Solby, to her sister. She owns the sunny hill by your farm, and says: "
"whoever rows me and my chests gets the hill! She has three chests."
msgstr ""
"Halla ime e vjetër Gerd shkon në Solby, te motra e saj. Ajo ka kodrën me diell pranë fermës "
"{crew|sate|sate|suaj}, dhe thotë: kush më çon mua dhe sënduqet e mia, e merr kodrën! Ka tri "
"sënduqe."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd's chests? Bring her too!"
msgstr "Sënduqet e hallës Gerd? {crew|Sille|Sille|Silleni} edhe atë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd: My chests! Careful, the blue one has my grandmother's spoons."
msgstr "Halla Gerd: Sënduqet e mia! Kujdes, tek ai blu janë lugët e gjyshes sime."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My sister! And my chests! You are good girls. The sunny hill is yours: plant something beautiful "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Motra ime! Dhe sënduqet e mia! {crew|Je djalë i mirë|Je vajzë e mirë|Jeni fëmijë të mirë|Jeni "
"vajza të mira}. Kodra me diell është {crew|jotja|jotja|juaja}: {crew|mbill|mbill|mbillni} diçka të"
" bukur në të."

