#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grandma's Birthday"
msgstr "Ditëlindja e gjyshes"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Psst! Your grandmother turns seventy in two days. A surprise: a new shawl from Sæunn, a cake from "
"Gudrun, and me as a guest. Do not tell her!"
msgstr ""
"Pst! Gjyshja {crew|jote|jote|juaj} mbush shtatëdhjetë vjeç pas dy ditësh. Një surprizë: një shall "
"i ri nga Sæunn, një tortë nga Gudrun, dhe unë si mysafire. Mos i {crew|thuaj|thuaj|thoni} gjë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Blue, like her eyes. Hide it under the hay!"
msgstr "Blu, si sytë e saj. {crew|Fshihe|Fshihe|Fshiheni} nën sanë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey cake with seventy almonds. I counted!"
msgstr "Kuleç me mjaltë me shtatëdhjetë bajame. I numërova!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A shawl? A cake? Tova? Oh, my girls... Seventy years, and this is my happiest birthday."
msgstr ""
"Një shall? Një tortë? Tova? Oh, {crew|djali im|vajza ime|fëmijët e mi|vajzat e mia}... "
"Shtatëdhjetë vjet, dhe kjo është ditëlindja ime më e lumtur."

