#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/080_grandmothers_birthday/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Few vikings lived to seventy; the old were honoured for what they knew."
msgstr "Pak vikingë jetonin deri në shtatëdhjetë; të moshuarit nderoheshin për atë që dinin."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Healers' Round"
msgstr "Xhiroja e shëruesve"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You are ready. Do my round alone today: look at the lambs in Ålberga, the horses in Torsgården and"
" the swans in Svanetorp. Then come and tell me."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Je gati|Je gati|Jeni gati}. {crew|Bëje|Bëje|Bëjeni} vetë xhiron time sot: "
"{crew|shiko|shiko|shikoni} qengjat në Ålberga, kuajt në Torsgården dhe mjellmat në Svanetorp. "
"Pastaj {crew|eja|eja|ejani} e {crew|më trego|më trego|më tregoni}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "You look in their eyes, their ears, their hooves... All well? Good! They like you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Shikon|Shikon|Shikoni} sytë, veshët, thundrat e tyre... Gjithçka mirë? Mirë! {crew|Të|Të|Ju}"
" duan."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bror is old, but well. Silke's new foal is strong. Tell Tova all is fine."
msgstr ""
"Bror është plak, por mirë. Mëzi i ri i Silkes është i fortë. {crew|Thuaji|Thuaji|Thuajini} Tovës "
"se gjithçka është mirë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The swans? Fat and happy. One has a sore wing: you wrapped it well."
msgstr ""
"Mjellmat? Të majme dhe të lumtura. Njëra ka një krah të lënduar: {crew|e lidhe|e lidhe|e lidhët} "
"mirë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All well, and the swan's wing wrapped? Then take this: your own healer's bag. You are healers now."
msgstr ""
"Gjithçka mirë, dhe krahu i mjellmës i lidhur? Atëherë {crew|merre|merre|merreni} këtë: çanta "
"{crew|jote|jote|juaj} e shëruesit. Tani {crew|je shërues|je shëruese|jeni shërues|jeni shëruese}."

#. a gift for a task: 'You get ...'
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "your own healer's bag"
msgstr "çanta {crew|jote|jote|juaj} e shëruesit"

#. the thing 'your own healer's bag' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the direct
#. object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain
#. translation
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "your own healer's bag"
msgstr "çantën {crew|tënde|tënde|tuaj} të shëruesit"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/081_the_healers_round/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Healers looked, listened and touched: they had no tools but their hands and their herbs."
msgstr "Shëruesit shikonin, dëgjonin dhe preknin: s'kishin vegla përveç duarve dhe barishteve."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Colt in the Mud"
msgstr "Mëzi në baltë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Silke's colt ran into the bog and is stuck to his belly! I need a long rope: Tor in Stormvik has "
"the longest. Hurry, he is scared!"
msgstr ""
"Mëzi i Silkes vrapoi në moçal dhe ka ngecur deri te barku! Më duhet një litar i gjatë: Tori në "
"Stormvik ka më të gjatin. {crew|Nxito|Nxito|Nxitoni}, ka frikë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rope around him, gently, everybody pull... Slurp! He is out! Muddy, but well. You saved him."
msgstr ""
"Litarin rreth tij, butë, të gjithë tërhiqni... Slurp! Doli! Me baltë, por mirë. {crew|E shpëtove|E"
" shpëtove|E shpëtuat}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My longest rope! Take it, quick!"
msgstr "Litari im më i gjatë! {crew|Merre|Merre|Merreni}, shpejt!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Rope"
msgstr "Litar"

#. a thing of a task; {count|...|...} picks the form for the number {count} (one, then the others;
#. see the Plural-Forms of this file for how many forms your language has), e.g., '{count|a crate of
#. salt|{count} crates of salt}'
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "the long rope"
msgstr "litari i gjatë"

#. the thing 'the long rope' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the direct
#. object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain
#. translation
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "the long rope"
msgstr "litarin e gjatë"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/082_the_colt_in_the_mud/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A horse stuck in mud must be pulled out slowly, or it hurts its legs."
msgstr "Një kalë i ngecur në baltë duhet nxjerrë ngadalë, përndryshe lëndon këmbët."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grain for the North"
msgstr "Drithë për veriun"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My hunters send news: the summer in the north was cold, and their families have no grain. My ship "
"leaves in three days: fill it with twelve crates!"
msgstr ""
"Gjahtarët e mi dërgojnë lajm: vera në veri ishte e ftohtë, dhe familjet e tyre s'kanë drithë. "
"Anija ime niset pas tri ditësh: {crew|mbushe|mbushe|mbusheni} me dymbëdhjetë arka!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve crates! Nobody in the north goes hungry this winter. The whole valley thanks you."
msgstr ""
"Dymbëdhjetë arka! Askush në veri nuk do të mbetet i uritur këtë dimër. Gjithë lugina "
"{crew|të|të|ju} falënderon."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/083_grain_for_the_north/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "When the harvest failed, the farms helped each other: next year, it might be them."
msgstr ""
"Kur dështonin të korrat, fermat ndihmonin njëra-tjetrën: vitin tjetër mund të ishin ato në nevojë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Wool Fair"
msgstr "Panairi i leshit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The wool fair! Traders come from the Long Lake to buy. Bring me eight crates of wool, the more the"
" better, and the fair is a success."
msgstr ""
"Panairi i leshit! Tregtarët vijnë nga Liqeni i Gjatë për të blerë. {crew|Më sill|Më sill|Më "
"sillni} tetë arka me lesh, sa më shumë aq më mirë, dhe panairi do të jetë sukses."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Eight crates! The traders from the Long Lake ask: who are these girls? I say: the best traders of "
"the Home Lakes."
msgstr ""
"Tetë arka! Tregtarët nga Liqeni i Gjatë pyesin: {crew|kush është ky djalë|kush është kjo "
"vajzë|kush janë këta fëmijë|kush janë këto vajza}? Unë them: tregtarët më të mirë të Liqeneve të "
"Shtëpisë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/084_the_wool_fair/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool was so important that some sagas tell of whole ships full of it."
msgstr "Leshi ishte aq i rëndësishëm sa disa saga tregojnë për anije të tëra plot me të."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Goats on the Island"
msgstr "Dhitë në ishull"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My four goats swam to Bergö! They eat Dagny's flowers, and she is cross. Bring them back before "
"they eat her kiln too!"
msgstr ""
"Katër dhitë e mia notuan deri në Bergö! Po hanë lulet e Dagnysë, dhe ajo është e zemëruar. "
"{crew|Silli|Silli|Sillini} prapa para se t'i hanë edhe furrën!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My naughty goats! Tomorrow I build a higher fence. Here, my best cheese."
msgstr "Dhitë e mia të prapa! Nesër ndërtoj një gardh më të lartë. Ja, djathi im më i mirë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take them, take them! They ate my flowers and a basket and a shoe!"
msgstr ""
"{crew|Merri|Merri|Merrini}, {crew|merri|merri|merrini}! Më hëngrën lulet, një shportë dhe një "
"këpucë!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/085_the_goats_on_the_island/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats are good swimmers when they must be, and they eat nearly anything."
msgstr "Dhitë notojnë mirë kur duhet, dhe hanë pothuajse gjithçka."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "News for Everybody"
msgstr "Lajme për të gjithë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Big news: a ship from the Long Lake will come, and the way between the lakes opens! Tell the "
"smith, the fishers of Stormvik and Orm in Hallvik. I tell the rest."
msgstr ""
"Lajm i madh: do të vijë një anije nga Liqeni i Gjatë, dhe rruga mes liqeneve hapet! "
"{crew|Lajmëro|Lajmëro|Lajmëroni} farkëtarin, peshkatarët e Stormvik dhe Ormin në Hallvik. Të "
"tjerëve u tregoj unë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A ship from the Long Lake? They will want my iron!"
msgstr "Një anije nga Liqeni i Gjatë? Do të duan hekurin tim!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "New lakes, new fish! Thank you for telling us."
msgstr "Liqene të reja, peshk i ri! Faleminderit që na e {crew|the|the|thatë}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Guests from far away! I must brew more. Thank you, girls!"
msgstr ""
"Mysafirë nga larg! Duhet të bëj më shumë birrë. Faleminderit, {crew|djalë|vajzë|fëmijë|vajza}!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/086_news_for_everybody/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The lakes of the north were joined by rivers and portages, where boats were dragged over land."
msgstr "Liqenet e veriut lidheshin me lumenj dhe kalime, ku barkat tërhiqeshin mbi tokë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Cow for Grim"
msgstr "Një lopë për Grimin"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I am old, and I would like fresh milk every morning. Bring me a cow from the horse farm. The swans"
" will be jealous!"
msgstr ""
"Jam plak, dhe do të doja qumësht të freskët çdo mëngjes. {crew|Më sill|Më sill|Më sillni} një lopë"
" nga ferma e kuajve. Mjellmat do të kenë zili!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A cow! I call her Swan, ha. Here, for your trouble, and for all the years you visited an old man."
msgstr ""
"Një lopë! Do ta quaj Mjellmë, ha. Ja, për mundin {crew|tënd|tënd|tuaj}, dhe për gjithë vitet që "
"{crew|e vizitove|e vizitove|e vizituat} një plak."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/087_a_cow_for_grim/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good cow gave milk for ten years or more, and was part of the family."
msgstr "Një lopë e mirë jepte qumësht për dhjetë vjet e më shumë, dhe ishte pjesë e familjes."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flowers on the Hill"
msgstr "Lule në kodër"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plant flowers on the sunny hill! When they bloom, bring three crates to Gudrun's inn: she wants "
"the inn to smell like summer."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Mbill|Mbill|Mbillni} lule në kodrën me diell! Kur të lulëzojnë, {crew|çoji|çoji|çojini} tri "
"arka te hani i Gudrunës: ajo do që hani të ketë erë vere."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flower seeds in the earth. In two days, they bloom."
msgstr "Farë lulesh në dhe. Pas dy ditësh lulëzojnë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Flowers on every table! The guests smile. Here is your silver, and a cup of milk for each of you."
msgstr ""
"Lule në çdo tryezë! Mysafirët buzëqeshin. Ja argjendi {crew|yt|yt|juaj}, dhe {crew|një filxhan "
"qumësht për ty|një filxhan qumësht për ty|nga një filxhan qumësht për secilin}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/088_flowers_on_the_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Vikings wove flowers into wreaths and crowns for feasts and weddings."
msgstr "Vikingët thurnin lule në kurora për festa dhe dasma."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Pottery Market"
msgstr "Tregu i enëve"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/089_the_pottery_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The new kiln makes so many pots! Bring ten crates to the market in Kråkhamn. Ten crates: only your"
" big boat can do it."
msgstr ""
"Furra e re bën kaq shumë enë! {crew|Çoji|Çoji|Çojini} dhjetë arka në tregun e Kråkhamn. Dhjetë "
