#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Edge of the Forest"
msgstr "Buza e pyllit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Kol and Ingrid want sheep for their new home. Bring them two sheep, and I give you the strip of "
"land by the forest, next to your farm. A fair trade!"
msgstr ""
"Koli dhe Ingrid duan dele për shtëpinë e tyre të re. {crew|Çoju|Çoju|Çojuni} dy dele, dhe {crew|të"
" jap|të jap|ju jap} rripin e tokës pranë pyllit, ngjitur me fermën {crew|tënde|tënde|tuaj}. Një "
"shkëmbim i drejtë!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two sheep for the young ones! Ingrid already knits. The forest edge is yours: good wood and two "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Dy dele për të rinjtë! Ingrid tashmë thur. Buza e pyllit është {crew|jotja|jotja|juaja}: dru i "
"mirë dhe dy ara."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/091_the_edge_of_the_forest/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Land was traded for animals, silver or work: there were no banks."
msgstr "Toka shkëmbehej me kafshë, argjend ose punë: nuk kishte banka."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Longhouse Grows"
msgstr "Shtëpia e gjatë rritet"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With so many animals and friends, our house is too small! Bring twelve logs from Frosttorp, two "
"crates of tools and two pots of tar, and we make it longer."
msgstr ""
"Me kaq shumë kafshë dhe miq, shtëpia jonë është shumë e vogël! {crew|Sill|Sill|Sillni} dymbëdhjetë"
" trungje nga Frosttorp, dy arka me vegla dhe dy poçe me katran, dhe e zgjatim."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Twelve logs! Fill that big hold of yours."
msgstr "Dymbëdhjetë trungje! {crew|Mbushe|Mbushe|Mbusheni} atë barkë të madhe."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Axes and nails. Now the tar for the roof."
msgstr "Sëpata dhe gozhdë. Tani katrani për çatinë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hammering all night with the neighbours... Our longhouse is twice as long! Room for a feast."
msgstr ""
"Duke goditur me çekiç gjithë natën me fqinjët... Shtëpia jonë e gjatë është dyfish më e gjatë! "
"Vend për një festë."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/092_the_longhouse_grows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A longhouse could be made longer by adding a piece at the end, like a train."
msgstr "Një shtëpi e gjatë mund të zgjatej duke i shtuar një pjesë në fund, si një tren."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Green Valley"
msgstr "Lugina e gjelbër"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You helped my valley all year. The green valley behind your farm has no owner: bring me two crates"
" of cloth and two of honey for the gods' feast, and it is yours."
msgstr ""
"{crew|E ndihmove|E ndihmove|E ndihmuat} luginën time gjithë vitin. Lugina e gjelbër pas fermës "
"{crew|sate|sate|suaj} s'ka pronar: {crew|më sill|më sill|më sillni} dy arka me pëlhurë dhe dy me "
"mjaltë për festën e zotave, dhe është {crew|jotja|jotja|juaja}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cloth for the hall. Now the honey."
msgstr "Pëlhurë për sallën. Tani mjalti."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Father says it at the Thing, in front of everybody: the green valley belongs to Ylva and Sigrid!"
msgstr "Babai e thotë në Kuvend, para të gjithëve: lugina e gjelbër u përket Ylvës dhe Sigridës!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/093_the_green_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At the Thing, the meeting of the free people, land and laws were decided."
msgstr "Në Kuvend, mbledhjen e njerëzve të lirë, vendoseshin tokat dhe ligjet."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees for the Valley"
msgstr "Bletë për luginën"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The valley is full of clover and heather. Bees would love it! Have three beehives on the farm, and"
" we will have honey all year."
msgstr ""
"Lugina është plot me tërfil dhe shqopë. Bletëve do t'u pëlqente! {crew|Mbaj|Mbaj|Mbani} tri "
"koshere në fermë, dhe do të kemi mjaltë gjithë vitin."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hum, hum, hum! Three hives in the valley. Honey for us, and for mead."
msgstr "Zzz, zzz, zzz! Tri koshere në luginë. Mjaltë për ne, dhe për hidromel."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/094_bees_for_the_valley/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Heather honey is dark and strong; clover honey is light and mild."
msgstr "Mjalti i shqopës është i errët dhe i fortë; mjalti i tërfilit është i çelët dhe i butë."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/095_apples_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Apples for the Market"
msgstr "Mollë për tregun"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/095_apples_for_the_market/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Thanks to the bees, my trees are full of apples! Twelve baskets for the market in Kråkhamn. Only "
"your boat can take them all at once."
msgstr ""
"Falë bletëve, pemët e mia janë plot me mollë! Dymbëdhjetë shporta për tregun në Kråkhamn. Vetëm "
