#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Winter Stores"
msgstr "Rezervat e dimrit"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn again! Before the lakes freeze, fill the store: ten crates of hay and six of grain, within "
"three days. You know how by now!"
msgstr ""
"Përsëri vjeshtë! Para se të ngrijnë liqenet, {crew|mbushe|mbushe|mbusheni} hambarin: dhjetë arka "
"me sanë dhe gjashtë me drithë, brenda tri ditësh. Tashmë e {crew|di|di|dini} si!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for all our animals. Now the grain."
msgstr "Sanë për të gjitha kafshët tona. Tani drithi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full to the roof! Not one animal will be hungry this winter."
msgstr "Hambari është plot deri në çati! Asnjë kafshë nuk do të ketë uri këtë dimër."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn was the busiest time: everything for the long winter had to be in."
msgstr "Vjeshta ishte koha më e ngarkuar: gjithçka për dimrin e gjatë duhej të ishte brenda."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
