#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "Ftesat"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We hold a feast here on the farm, for all our friends! Invite them: hail three boats on the lakes,"
" and visit Tova and Ragnfrid."
msgstr ""
"Bëjmë një festë këtu në fermë, për të gjithë miqtë tanë! {crew|Ftoji|Ftoji|Ftojini}: "
"{crew|përshëndet|përshëndet|përshëndetni} tri barka në liqene, dhe {crew|vizito|vizito|vizitoni} "
"Tovën dhe Ragnfridën."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast? Of course! I will tell everybody on the lakes."
msgstr "Festë? Sigurisht! Do t'u tregoj të gjithëve në liqene."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast at your farm? We come, and bring our fiddle!"
msgstr "Festë në fermën {crew|tënde|tënde|tuaj}? Vijmë, dhe sjellim violinën!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Count on me! I bring my best fish."
msgstr "{crew|Mbështetu|Mbështetu|Mbështetuni} tek unë! Sjell peshkun tim më të mirë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I would not miss it! I come with my herb wine."
msgstr "Nuk do ta humbisja për asgjë! Vij me verën time me barishte."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We come with all the horses! Silke wants to see her daughter."
msgstr "Vijmë me të gjithë kuajt! Silke do të shohë të bijën."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A great feast could last a week, with guests from every farm around."
msgstr "Një festë e madhe mund të zgjaste një javë, me mysafirë nga çdo fermë përreth."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Food for the Feast"
msgstr "Ushqim për festën"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many guests! Bring four crates of mead, four of ale and four of cheese. Twelve crates: your big"
" boat can do it, but you must buy well."
msgstr ""
"Kaq shumë mysafirë! {crew|Sill|Sill|Sillni} katër arka me hidromel, katër me birrë dhe katër me "
"djathë. Dymbëdhjetë arka: barka {crew|jote|jote|juaj} e madhe mund ta bëjë, por duhet të "
"{crew|blesh|blesh|blini} me mend."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the ale."
msgstr "Hidromel! Tani birra."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! Now the cheese."
msgstr "Birrë! Tani djathi."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everything is ready: the tables, the torches, the food. Now only the guests!"
msgstr "Gjithçka është gati: tryezat, pishtarët, ushqimi. Tani vetëm mysafirët!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At a feast, the host gave the best food and drink: being generous brought honour."
msgstr "Në festë, i zoti i shtëpisë jepte ushqimin dhe pijen më të mirë: bujaria sillte nder."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Feast at the Farm"
msgstr "Festa në fermë"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The guests come! But some have no boat: bring Old Grim from Svanetorp, Old Halvard from Solby, and"
" Tova from her island. Then the feast begins!"
msgstr ""
"Mysafirët po vijnë! Por disa s'kanë barkë: {crew|sill|sill|sillni} plakun Grim nga Svanetorp, "
"plakun Halvard nga Solby, dhe Tovën nga ishulli i saj. Pastaj fillon festa!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
